      "description": "Retrieves the status and results of a background agent.\n* Use this tool to check on agents started with mode: \"background\" in the task tool.\n* Returns the agent status (running, completed, failed) and results if available.\n* You will be automatically notified when background agents complete - use this tool to retrieve the full output after notification.\n* You can call this tool multiple times to read intermediate output while the agent is still running.\n* Set wait: true to block until the agent completes (with optional timeout).\n* If the agent is still running and wait is false, returns current status.",
